	measure 'Current Year Top 10% Customer Revenue' = ```
			
			VAR TopCustomerCount =
			    ROUNDUP(
			        [Current Year Active Customer Comparable] * 0.10,
			        0
			    )
			
			VAR ActiveCustomers =
			    FILTER(
			        ALL(DimCustomer[customer_id]),
			        [Delivered Order Count] > 0
			    ) VAR TopCustomer = TOPN(TopCustomerCount,ActiveCustomers,[Current Year Revenue],DESC)   RETURN SUMX(TopCustomer,[Current Year Revenue])                                                               
			```
		formatString: \$#,0.000;(\$#,0.000);\$#,0.000
		lineageTag: 1513e572-f6b3-4e1c-9c98-fc9377892b7e

